    "detailed_description": "Potions! is an ingredient juggling, potion slinging, 2D, pixel-art shop management game<br><br>Brew and sell potions to customers during the day - prep during the night.<br>Drink potions to survive your enemies.<br>Unlock spells to defend your bustling Potion Cart.<br>And move on to the next town, before your time runs out...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Buy ingredients and combine them to make Potions</strong><br>Sell potions to customers or drink them yourself, to stay on top of your busy Potion Cart</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Manage stock, orders and customers</strong><br>Fill your recipe book with new Potions, while juggling ingredients from different regions.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Travel across the land seeking new recipes and ingredients</strong> <br>9 regions with different customers, spells, recipes and dangers await you.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Brave foul enemies and mysterious customers</strong><br>Collect spells to ward off those that might disrupt your shop</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Endless unique customers</strong><br>Serve a range of procedurally generated customers from different races, as you make your way across the land.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Froggin will keep you company!</strong><br>Your enchanted frog will soothe you with local melodies.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876530/extras/f83c35bc0c21a5901ea7d656c33fc493.webp?t=1670479320\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Potions! is an ingredient juggling, potion slinging, 2D, pixel-art shop management game<br><br>Brew and sell potions to customers during the day - prep during the night.<br>Drink potions to survive your enemies.<br>Unlock spells to defend your bustling Potion Cart.<br>And move on to the next town, before your time runs out...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Buy ingredients and combine them to make Potions</strong><br>Sell potions to customers or drink them yourself, to stay on top of your busy Potion Cart</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Manage stock, orders and customers</strong><br>Fill your recipe book with new Potions, while juggling ingredients from different regions.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Travel across the land seeking new recipes and ingredients</strong> <br>9 regions with different customers, spells, recipes and dangers await you.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Brave foul enemies and mysterious customers</strong><br>Collect spells to ward off those that might disrupt your shop</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Endless unique customers</strong><br>Serve a range of procedurally generated customers from different races, as you make your way across the land.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Froggin will keep you company!</strong><br>Your enchanted frog will soothe you with local melodies.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876530/extras/f83c35bc0c21a5901ea7d656c33fc493.webp?t=1670479320\" /></div>",
